            "content": "<p>Keep your skincare simple and gentle.</p><p>During use, only use a glide or skincare product that is specifically appropriate for microneedling and follow the instructions provided with your device or product. Do not assume that every facial serum is suitable for use during microneedling.</p><p>Afterward, focus on gentle hydration and barrier support. A simple, fragrance-free moisturizer can help keep the skin comfortable and hydrated.</p><p>Avoid harsh exfoliants, strong acids, retinoids, or irritating products immediately after your routine.</p>"
